  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Lán來講看māi - 台灣ài有家己ê教師節kah哲學節"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《台灣ài有家己ê教師節kah哲學節》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/李旺庭</span></h2><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgjjdUAnGluXySUsudWikwLkY0XIX1mU0u870t68gQRa_Fk32MgtPGPcltTN0yEBYu7juPgV2t5xtgTlTF-wbmQfr-0w07dQKyxRFms5rN2mTvD7TT1aY85wbURQLgppqKTmADiFwU2OEgw4bhV7TMKtVt6GQhg5CrlR2V5gytW2nz-Qi3OuFropoiQRUBA\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgjjdUAnGluXySUsudWikwLkY0XIX1mU0u870t68gQRa_Fk32MgtPGPcltTN0yEBYu7juPgV2t5xtgTlTF-wbmQfr-0w07dQKyxRFms5rN2mTvD7TT1aY85wbURQLgppqKTmADiFwU2OEgw4bhV7TMKtVt6GQhg5CrlR2V5gytW2nz-Qi3OuFropoiQRUBA=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEigQmzPk3OL8LkjizkjBE9VyLZCMXIGalaifZETZKHFCm5UGpvqKFGo9omxDJEotFwPjyjfGyFJAl6t06f35d4Yk5PsDrbmmHGlWvfHkEMA1FU_ZzoHDS9eQQuGvUHM78sE72QrECvR4kqoeLXmOTf6mEMqWu2qXpV1517Cj-xT2GCM67EGvwluqLv-vgmr\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEigQmzPk3OL8LkjizkjBE9VyLZCMXIGalaifZETZKHFCm5UGpvqKFGo9omxDJEotFwPjyjfGyFJAl6t06f35d4Yk5PsDrbmmHGlWvfHkEMA1FU_ZzoHDS9eQQuGvUHM78sE72QrECvR4kqoeLXmOTf6mEMqWu2qXpV1517Cj-xT2GCM67EGvwluqLv-vgmr=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjf08jEp32XmqN49umUXdYllBbX3wLgmjrZKbvtiEFW1py1FhMmQENcqxb1HW67DbHoScNvQUQRgTLmmymmKBI4AIkK3OaQUtEgd5rxtuEpzAazn-RtHbV-ABPwDXpYfwEUh8gMe6grNk2v4JECgiScWAM8uSIqzaS31PIqLRZJ7zZWqhdq1J1BHiFgN0GJ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1350\" data-original-width=\"1080\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjf08jEp32XmqN49umUXdYllBbX3wLgmjrZKbvtiEFW1py1FhMmQENcqxb1HW67DbHoScNvQUQRgTLmmymmKBI4AIkK3OaQUtEgd5rxtuEpzAazn-RtHbV-ABPwDXpYfwEUh8gMe6grNk2v4JECgiScWAM8uSIqzaS31PIqLRZJ7zZWqhdq1J1BHiFgN0GJ=w512-h640\" width=\"512\" /></a></div><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">78冬前ê 3月11，lán ê哲學家林茂生（Lîm Bō͘-seng）去hō͘國民黨政權掠走，就無koh tńg--來--ah。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Hiàng-chūn tī學校，若讀哲學，khah bat--ê lóng是歐美ê哲學家，到有一工，阮阿爸送我《存在交涉：日治時期的臺灣哲學》chit本冊，chiah知lán台灣bat有林茂生、林秋梧、林素琴、洪耀勳濟濟hiah-nī仔有才情koh關心社會處境ê思想家，chiok感動，mā chiok感慨、見笑，是按怎對lán ê過去bat hiah少？</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">林茂生先生是台南人，bat tī台南讀冊、教冊，伊規世人拚勢leh思考哲學，而且kā伊ê思想實踐tī台灣chit phiàn土地。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">林茂生是現代台灣哲學重要ê推動者，tī 1916年發表ê文章〈王陽明の良知說〉，伊kō͘德國觀念論kah日本陽明學，去比較Khàng-thoh（Immanuel Kant）kah王陽明ê思想，是台灣歷史上頭一篇現代哲學論文。Ùi 1924年連sòa三冬，伊mā tī台灣文化協會舉辦ê夏季學校擔任講師，講--ê是哲學kah西洋文明史。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">1929年，tī美國hit時一粒一ê哲學家Tiú-ùi（John Dewey）ê指導下，林茂生以《日本統治下台灣ê學校教育——其發展以及有關文化ê歷史分析kah探討》chit篇論文提著博士學位，chiâⁿ做台灣頭一位留學美國ê哲學博士。林茂生ê論文真注重母語，因為母語「是活跳--ê、成長--ê、變化--ê，koh表達台灣人民ê思想kah感情--ê」，伊用近代教育原則批判日本總督府ê同化政策，認為同化無重學習者ê個性kah天賦能力，所致「行為ê自由kah獨立才智ê效力ē屈就tī kan-taⁿ是模仿ê習慣」，伊mā ǹg望透過教育來深化民主，「要求有平等ê機會去發揮in（台灣人）上kôan ê能力」，tháu放才智ê潛能chiah thang有正pān ê民主生活。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">3月11是lán ê哲學家受難ê日子。Chit工，mā是我心目中ê台灣教師節kah台灣哲學節。Lán應該tī chit工記念林茂生先生ê精神kah勇氣。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">文章起頭ê hit幅圖是陳和志ê作品（「2024第二屆311台灣教師節電子賀卡設計比賽」入選作品），色水真有活力，屬tī lán台灣ê思想定著是chiah-nī súi！</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">作者註：文中引用ê文句，是ùi林茂生ê博士論文《日本統治下台灣ê學校教育——其發展以及有關文化ê歷史分析kah探討》第八章（理論上ê問題）摘--ê。原文是英文，林俊育先生kā翻做台文。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 378期，2025年9月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left;\"></p></div></span></div></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></h3><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div align=\"center\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。  </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div></div></span></div></h2></div></div><br /><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></div>"
